{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415763","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415763","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1041576301:1":{"text":"シルフィス、宴の誘いを断っておきながら、マーリンのところにいるとはな。","source_cn":"奥菲戈斯，你拒绝了我的宴会邀请，却出现在了梅林这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99C42CB2C628E57F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041576302:1":{"text":"我の宴よりも、マーリンの住まいで過ごす方が気に入ったのか？","source_cn":"难道说，相比于我的宴会，你现在更喜欢在梅林的居所消磨时...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x720BBB0BDB18C50E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041576303:1":{"text":"そんなことはありませんわ。ただ、たまには場所を変えて、静かに過ごしたいのですよ。","source_cn":"别这么说，偶尔也让我换个地方清净一下吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8D57B8130871C52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041576304:1":{"text":"あなたの宴に行くと、いつも演奏させられてしまいますもの。","source_cn":"我只要一去你的宴会，不免又会被你怂恿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x574975B5EA79786D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041576305:1":{"text":"こちらは休む間もなく演奏し続けているのに、涼しい顔で楽しんでいる誰かさんを見るとねぇ……","source_cn":"结果就是，整场宴会中我一直在不停歇地演奏，你反而成了最...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2185BE358DC58934","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_ti